   // ---- the three groups ------------------------------------------------------------------
   // Rooted on VIEWS. The ~primaryKey IS the view's ~groupBy, which is what makes one
   // instance a GROUP and not a row: navigating in crosses a GROUP BY and cannot come back
   // out. An absent group is not a zero -- a cell with no exposures on a date does not form.

   regulatory_capital::RcpRwaByApproachClass[rcpRwaCell]: Relational
   {
